# ClearDose — copy to .env (never commit real credentials)
# Photo reading via Amazon Rekognition is OFF by default.
# REKOGNITION_ENABLED=true
# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# + standard AWS credentials with rekognition:DetectText permission ONLY.
# The AWS account must be fully activated; an unactivated account
# cannot call Rekognition. Never use root credentials for this tool.
